  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.39: Bound large historical PR discovery with minimal metadata, paged responses, live-header cache validation and same-scope resume guidance. Expose attribution-completeness warnings and add offline historical-note/EHE refresh plans with independent permissions and locks. Connect explicitly declared implementation dates to review and refresh allocations; conserve one rounded period EHE/8 multiplier while preserving retained attribution. Source EHE totals, estimator priors and rates are unchanged. EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated; external date allocations do not recover discarded Git workdays or prove actual labor, and refresh plans do not edit entries. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.39/CHANGELOG.md",
